{
  "id": "E331",
  "title": "Plain Boiled Water",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2019-06-09",
  "synopsis": "Why do Chinese people always drink warm water?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1065/fbbf51473fab84708a9de9e2e7b39fd7d55223a7.mp3?1559200147",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "白开水\n\n丽丽：欢迎来我家做客！喝点什么？\n小乐：不用麻烦，白开水就好了。\n保罗：白-开-水？这是什么？\n小乐：就是烧开后什么都不加的水。在中国，自来水一般不能直接喝，所以大家习惯把水烧开以后再喝。\n保罗：那我还是喝咖啡吧。",
    "traditional": "白開水\n\n麗麗：歡迎來我家做客！喝點什麼？\n小樂：不用麻煩，白開水就好了。\n保羅：白-開-水？這是什麼？\n小樂：就是燒開後什麼都不加的水。在中國，自來水一般不能直接喝，所以大家習慣把水燒開以後再喝。\n保羅：那我還是喝咖啡吧。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Plain Boiled Water"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "丽丽：欢迎来我家做客！喝点什么？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：歡迎來我家做客！喝點什麼？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì huān yíng lái wǒ jiā zuò kè hē diǎn shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Welcome to my home as my guests! Something to drink?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小乐：不用麻烦，白开水就好了。",
      "traditional": "小樂：不用麻煩，白開水就好了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè bú yòng má fan bái kāi shuǐ jiù hǎo le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: No need to bother, just plain boiled water will do."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "保罗：白-开-水？这是什么？",
      "traditional": "保羅：白-開-水？這是什麼？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó bái kāi shuǐ zhè shì shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: White-open-water? What is that?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小乐：就是烧开后什么都不加的水。",
      "traditional": "小樂：就是燒開後什麼都不加的水。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè jiù shì shāo kāi hòu shén me dōu bù jiā de shuǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "在中国，自来水一般不能直接喝，所以大家习惯把水烧开以后再喝。",
      "traditional": "在中國，自來水一般不能直接喝，所以大家習慣把水燒開以後再喝。",
      "pinyin": "zài zhōng guó zì lái shuǐ yì bān bù néng zhí jiē hē suǒ yǐ dà jiā xí guàn bǎ shuǐ shāo kāi yǐ hòu zài hē",
      "english": "Little Le: It is boiled water without anything added."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "In China, tap water is generally not drinkable straight away, so everyone usually boils water and then drink it."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "保罗：那我还是喝咖啡吧。",
      "traditional": "保羅：那我還是喝咖啡吧。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó nà wǒ hái shi hē kā fēi ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Then I’ll just drink coffee."
    }
  ],
